tweets.text:
@TheJusticeDept filed a petition to enforce administrative subpoenas issued to four Oregon counties by ICE Homeland Security Investigations Seattle.

ICE special agents believe Clackamas, Washington, Multnomah and Marion Counties still harbor 10 dangerous convicted felons. The communities released these criminal aliens into the local communities — disregarding our detainers.

➡️Learn more in our newsroom.

